{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "21634c5fe2ee021bf99d462fe4a85ec24a320da85629116e4dc6234bc7b558f6", "ja": "イケメンの見本", "zh": "帅哥的范本", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "058a5f7ab2454cc5f45f106899af91c5f012bf1dc5019dc54cf3c01274fdd865", "ja": "仕事上がり、莉緒と歌織に誘われて飲みに\n行くプロデューサー。イケメンの男性役に\n悩む莉緒は、歌織やプロデューサーの\nアドバイスに聞き入る。やがて話題は、\nプロデューサーの恋バナへと移っていく。", "zh": "莉绪和歌织邀请工作结束的制作人去喝一杯。\n莉绪烦恼着怎么演帅气男角，\n并专心聆听歌织和制作人给的建议。\n不久后，聊天的内容便转移到制作人的\n感情话题上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8bc679dec21b79a4b54c0771456185fc21371f75833ab8c8924290e89699771d", "ja": "（今日の仕事はこれで終わりだ……そろそろ帰ろう。\nさて、夕飯はどうしようかな……）", "zh": "（今天的工作就到此结束……差不多该回去了。\n好了，晚餐该怎么办呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "7771398be8763ca1f3237569820e42ed15e481dff2f360e4d35f035fb99541ff", "ja": "あらっ、{$P$}くんじゃない！\nお疲れさま♪", "zh": "哎呀，这不是{$P$}吗！\n辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "68278078232d694bf95e0080a8c2339dbd9703ffb17edfa92969c839e68b0816", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "01d9b909afea2d1c62dd4ac3974f214f9aa8438e4bb0f7806041e4bf906ea1a2", "ja": "莉緒、それに歌織さんも。\nふたりとも、お疲れさま。", "zh": "是莉绪还有歌织小姐啊。\n你们俩也辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "8f516ef0ffa163221beadad9ecb4353f35650b26c92c8d0e6f36e00a10d324ae", "ja": "ねえねえ、もしかして{$P$}くん、\n今から帰るところ？", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}，\n你该不会正要回家吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0021fa09947e5df9d871c267d26556e26d82a5228303f34669e49b348ed33067", "ja": "ああ、そうだけど……どうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯，是没错……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "e0ece8c9a681824a9c5bfc294b1e6cef4a2050f7f8ecd8faa71195b8e5b4ec6b", "ja": "ナイスタイミング！　今から飲みに行くんだけど、\n{$P$}くんも一緒に行かない？", "zh": "正好！我们现在要去喝一杯，\n{$P$}要不要也一起来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "0e6d28e0143693251158a56f2b700f88b3c93c7d00fb1f83d6f287bca73e1c1a", "ja": "莉緒ちゃんが見つけたお店なんですけど、\nお酒もメニューも、とっても美味しいんですよ♪", "zh": "莉绪发现了一家店，\n那边的酒跟餐点都非常可口喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c4e9725976651790b7a4ec02ca1c593fcd9a6c938418bdbec256d0bdd394ad8f", "ja": "へえ……いいですね。\nそれじゃあ、ご一緒させてもらおうかな。", "zh": "哦……这提议不错。\n就让我加入你们吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "48f9e62bc7ea196ff95935ef8ff04d63820e5d09359e31a1d92b350b9294be62", "ja": "やった♪\nそれじゃ、行きましょう！", "zh": "太好了♪\n那我们就出发吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "308997d8e409aede696dff317ca0529746f7c075f7fc71253342ad7aaf04dfde", "ja": "じゃーん♪　本日のお店は、こちらになりまーす。\nね、どう？　どう？　ステキなお店じゃない？", "zh": "锵锵──♪今天要拜访的是这家店～\n欸，怎么样？怎么样？不觉得这家店很棒吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1a0faa8f3bc0cffdc264025fe6453547084bde5b1cb2ed886242fa55ba0834df", "ja": "なるほど……確かに雰囲気の良いお店だな。", "zh": "原来如此……的确很有情调呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "0088726ccbccefc59b2ef1ab231dee39e539f961d523653d5dd0c8f984b7730d", "ja": "フフ、そうでしょ？\nこのみ姉さんと飲んでて、偶然見つけたのよ～！", "zh": "呵呵，我就说吧。\n这是我跟木实姊喝着喝着碰巧发现的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "dcaa3d7b22b722634d9484efee07609846db73736b3ee5cde0628fb44c81655c", "ja": "モテるためにも、こういうオシャレなお店は\nちゃんとリサーチしておかなくちゃね♪", "zh": "为了桃花运，要多多调查\n这种时髦的店家才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "1dee256ca7e5f8c055018e33efec0c25414219678d0a9f1e7f5c40ef63485133", "ja": "莉緒ちゃん、\nオシャレなお店に詳しいと、モテるの？", "zh": "莉绪，多知道一些时髦的店家\n就会有桃花运吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "09e522569f88fa2bec9c737702dd08bd4a3220a60323b6d93b9138c32d4a5b27", "ja": "えっ？　えっと……\nたぶん、そうじゃないかしら？", "zh": "咦？我想想……\n大概会有吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "518ea91f963af9beb892d605c5cec71b9d163ab1b7d03f52539cc20ccda80535", "ja": "それより、飲みましょ！\nはい、今日もお疲れさまでした！　カンパーイ♪", "zh": "不谈这个了，开喝开喝！\n来，今天也辛苦了！干杯──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1017_052kao", "source_sha256": "a45b19eed708208159767a55fea67f8d787a23b2706dfee5121754e127cc1cf0", "ja": "ふふっ。乾杯♪", "zh": "呵呵，干杯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "835e259d586a3e8c41754723ba555b83374b1a238f0b5535308202003fa19f24", "ja": "乾杯！", "zh": "干杯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f51dec10929885d679d44bba2d8c33c53a8de4e931ebf6ffcb566bd7ab8e3d55", "ja": "それで、『三姉妹カフェ』の稽古なんですけど。\n歌織さんは……。", "zh": "然后啊，关于《三姊妹咖啡厅》的练习，\n歌织小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1020_052kao", "source_sha256": "514d5ffef8e4fb73fe4cb11f59568c4185fd1564eef558e9a20c45bfc434a103", "ja": "ええ。私のほうは、おかげさまで順調です。最近、\n少しずつ演技の仕方がわかってきた気がして……。", "zh": "嗯，托你的福，我练习得非常顺利。\n最近，我觉得自己开始慢慢理解怎么演戏了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "c1d28eb644b96464f988e8ca031b2d3281d33b586e6dd5a148db437401503872", "ja": "歌織ちゃん、すごくがんばってるものね。", "zh": "毕竟小歌很努力嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "6a8159397b4e348aa4cc068771c6332139cafaa8b2f47370650b83e08e1f6c30", "ja": "そういう莉緒は、どうなんだ？\n飲みに行こうなんて誘うところをみると……。", "zh": "那莉绪你呢？\n看你这样约我来喝酒，想必是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1023_046rio", "source_sha256": "c5054e9c0781df733e667ae924292f91b9344a39053c70505390a4af20fc51ad", "ja": "もちろん順調♪　だと、よかったんだけど……。\n私は、ちょっと微妙かしら。", "zh": "当然再顺利不过♪如果是这样就好了……\n我的情况有点难讲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1024_052kao", "source_sha256": "6132104e5792270da0ff7f413930b136fd3b09f2fc234c400f1f35fc60951e13", "ja": "まあ、そうだったの？\nそんなふうに見えなかったけど……。", "zh": "哎呀，是这样吗？\n从你的表现看不太出来呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1025_046rio", "source_sha256": "370cc9d0f3170044e57b92376860f984498bee1154519ae74e56c06404a65c45", "ja": "私の役、イケメンのお客さんって設定でしょ？\n最初はね、面白そうって思ってたの。", "zh": "我饰演的角色，不是帅哥顾客吗？\n一开始我是觉得挺有意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "77da3752669a239a70af7b66a297f9fe0a26b12b94d7bae74524425c8d4c50cd", "ja": "でも、いざとなると、イケメンって…\n実際どういう人なのか、いまいちピンと来なくて。", "zh": "但试着演过以后，我才发现……\n自己其实不懂帅哥是指怎样的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "7091f79b3df3db875f304f9c532b81bdb2cb99635f586a73cb267ededa4605a9", "ja": "確かに……性別も違うし、イケメンってまず外見ありき\nだからな。人間性は、もう一歩踏み込まないと。", "zh": "的确……先是性别不同，加上帅哥又是以外表为前提。\n得更深入地了解角色的内心才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1028_p", "source_sha256": "f66e4a6cdb2d987c4beb95ed4b5d793612cd7e315699319cfab3271f78fa4acf", "ja": "でも、だからこそ、いい経験になると思うんだ。\n大丈夫、莉緒ならきっと演じきれるよ。", "zh": "不过，正因为如此，我觉得对你会是不错的经验。\n放心，我相信莉绪一定能诠释好这个角色的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1029_046rio", "source_sha256": "1b7b8d43256885620816b836a5bd6f2708763548ba39e2efad4c9f6e9ae0a93e", "ja": "だといいんだけどなぁ……。そもそも、男の子の\n気持ちっていうのが、今イチわからないのよね～。", "zh": "真能这样就好了……说起来，\n我连男生在想些什么都不是很懂啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1030_046rio", "source_sha256": "18956644482c207619e85a256395e956bfc5d7597f4132b8ede5f304236ff19a", "ja": "ほら、私がセクシーアピールすると、\nたまに引いちゃったりもするでしょ？", "zh": "你们想想，有时候我展现性感魅力，\n反而会有人因此却步，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "964eeb42f97c71de808342070701fd4248cacac58225cc395589fcddfb9c8d22", "ja": "う、うーん。何事も程度が大事というか、\nTPOも大事というか……。", "zh": "呃、嗯……不晓得该叫你注意分寸，\n还是该叫你留意时间地点跟场合……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1032_052kao", "source_sha256": "94705e5cc907a9facdaec52bd83125cc26e5a344666fc7bd5c0e21a8c696fd2e", "ja": "ねぇ、莉緒ちゃん。\n私、考えてみたんだけど……。", "zh": "欸，莉绪，\n我想了一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1033_052kao", "source_sha256": "c92cb6ed35b5c4d577feb037e995cc15b09c6f82273e7e012c95cf7230325ee5", "ja": "莉緒ちゃんが、一番カッコいいと思う男性を\nマネして演じてみるっていうのは、どうかしら？", "zh": "莉绪要不要试着模仿你觉得最帅的男性，\n去演这个角色看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1034_p", "source_sha256": "ed7f0acb57a3324d5897df2cd8747ccd464f8a8569b7c93d45654aafcddefd81", "ja": "なるほど！　それはいいかもしれませんね。", "zh": "原来如此！这或许是个好点子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1035_046rio", "source_sha256": "f10963fcdc64a8243adfca43173a1774e6ec2405f7e82294362b6e6362b370e2", "ja": "私がカッコいいと思う人かぁ……。\nじゃあ、{$P$}くんかな？", "zh": "我觉得帅的男生……\n那就是{$P$}了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1036_p", "source_sha256": "80fb86e2a901ac632a8c3fcaf6721a651e6fd28c214e9bd89eecf36ab1d3a3c0", "ja": "え……俺！？", "zh": "咦……我！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1037_046rio", "source_sha256": "3aa43d333cb31aad74c3622fbd94e25eb4ab9c2754690dd6b7a4d104a1174264", "ja": "うん。フフッ、見た目がどうこうってコトじゃ\nないけどね！　そうじゃなくて……。", "zh": "嗯。呵呵，说你帅不是在评论你的外表啦！\n真的不是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1038_046rio", "source_sha256": "d3ca360ada2dedefa50555add6205902e55bd4f4111f2afeec535376f0f53f5f", "ja": "ほら、今みたいに、いつも私達のこと、\n考えてくれるじゃない。そういうところだぞ♪", "zh": "是你会像现在这样，时时刻刻为我们着想，\n这种地方很帅喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1039_p", "source_sha256": "7377f11e5caa5cbabd736de873e13caae5ccb0a121cea304484578911f815015", "ja": "そ、そうか……。まあ、そう思ってもらえてるなら、\n俺も嬉しいよ。", "zh": "这、这样啊……也好，能让你这么觉得，\n我也很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1040_052kao", "source_sha256": "d8413ccf89d162cb4e374f00e95c7787a5d63bf7b929fc4b3faf920f9b160df2", "ja": "そうね……いいんじゃないかしら。\n莉緒ちゃんが演じる悠利も、とても優しい人よね？", "zh": "对耶……说不定可以呢。\n莉绪饰演的悠利，个性很温柔吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1041_052kao", "source_sha256": "65529399875700f4d0fd0ad293ad242ce573f0fb9a0c715ba62a5806f985be3f", "ja": "{$P$}さんなら、\nモデルにピッタリだと思うわ。", "zh": "如果是{$P$}先生，\n一定很适合拿来当模仿的对象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1042_046rio", "source_sha256": "cd67502a4e15171498e8f53f5b4e929446a9c12b99c473f20c1934c72ae03831", "ja": "そうね……うん、私も{$P$}くんだと\n思ったら、なんだかイメージが湧いてきたかも！", "zh": "是啊……嗯，联想到{$P$}以后，\n我好像开始有画面了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1043_046rio", "source_sha256": "75acc2d254ec9feeca65e4ec88179947e9be1a1ac9a2b24aaf5b6f53cb0983e4", "ja": "お話の中で、悠利と一夏がいい感じになるシーンも\nあるのよね……よろしくね、歌織ちゃん♪", "zh": "故事里面，还有悠利跟一夏气氛不错的场景对吧……\n到时候拜托你啰，小歌♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1044_052kao", "source_sha256": "eeea9dec997116e066cd9f7ec21f8e9328be2791f8b33ef399515056411f0b5b", "ja": "え、ええ。少し恥ずかしいけど……\nお互い、がんばろうね！", "zh": "好、好的，虽然有点难为情……\n我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "46d227b3006ad2d0381a216ef04cee1e5bc82b1a600881110b74d47c63e2b32f", "ja": "（……経緯はともかく、莉緒の悩みも解決の糸口が見つ\nかった。本番では、いい演技を見せてくれそうだ！）", "zh": "（……不管过程如何，莉绪也找到了解决烦恼的线索。\n正式开拍时，或许能看到让人惊艳的演技呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1046_046rio", "source_sha256": "cbcbc306584ada24d0fb18c2489e0e81af6f988de231849ecb2ac1d7f3df9a05", "ja": "そうだ、いい感じといえば。\nもうひとつ、聞いておきたいことがあるんだけど！", "zh": "对了，说到气氛不错，\n我还想问一件事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1047_p", "source_sha256": "259606f49c7245d5aa1e393f623eb7bf6000e496d8a89c78f7709ae7451bcfa6", "ja": "あ、まだあったのか。\nいいぞ、どんどん聞いてくれ！", "zh": "啊，还有呀？\n好，尽管问吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1048_046rio", "source_sha256": "e41c7e28841b60e934f26ff67f6abcb7861473ef747a6c59deb7e535e5de2e8d", "ja": "ありがと♪　それじゃ遠慮なく……\n{$P$}くん、今好きな人とかいるの？", "zh": "谢谢♪那我就不客气了……\n{$P$}，你现在有喜欢的对象吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1049_p", "source_sha256": "cf784dc8488275797d57732539b88ede2514867c53e9f09c9da31fe5111a0ae5", "ja": "は？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1050_052kao", "source_sha256": "baf5fea8216652f919ef83d8a2420167387ee34b5690a299dd7a86fff02b8dbf", "ja": "り、莉緒ちゃん！？\nそんな立ち入ったことを聞くのは……ど、どうかしら？", "zh": "莉、莉绪！？\n你怎么问这么隐私的问题……这、这样不太好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1051_046rio", "source_sha256": "a74bbe1e07b983cf0738c4176ef16e79c5e838388248223bef915c48a3d2d24b", "ja": "え～？　でも歌織ちゃんだって、この前は……", "zh": "咦～？可是小歌之前也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1052_052kao", "source_sha256": "e0fe9bb1bbc4f4a6898d6851a150e975107b188352448328e5318e91ab29a50c", "ja": "莉緒ちゃん！？", "zh": "莉绪！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_1054", "source_sha256": "f1cb18f30ec8996b5524544878ab5c81a38a040f65585da1d16317d74c91a860", "ja": "ははは！", "zh": "哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_2000_p", "source_sha256": "5fb9fcfffe13bbf4fc61e0bd5dd9eba57b1d77879dc184846112b3f4d893a10a", "ja": "ははは！　何かと思えば。\n莉緒、もう酔ったのか？", "zh": "哈哈哈！还以为你要问什么，\n莉绪，你已经醉了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_2001_052kao", "source_sha256": "aca51a0181304424e1fedbaa56a62026c26a96f3c91f84022e2d31aec1038238", "ja": "あっ。話をそらすということは……。\n好きな人、いらっしゃるんですか？", "zh": "啊，转移话题就代表……\n现在有喜欢的对象是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_2002_p", "source_sha256": "db8a9bf54cc008e1fe82637e6914f7bb16fb47636835264b13611205b884c052", "ja": "歌織さんまで！？", "zh": "连歌织小姐都！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_2003_046rio", "source_sha256": "2a08c7ddef5743968c2dbd2a2c1642502763ddd87f86b9149c771f674d9ef07b", "ja": "フフッ、ダメよ、簡単には逃がさないんだから♪\nここからは、オトナの話で盛り上がりましょ！", "zh": "呵呵，不行喔，我可不会轻易放过你♪\n接下来，就让我们来聊聊大人的话题吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_2004_p", "source_sha256": "5336e89ebfc3797eff80f170eca34038ed34343329896d14075906833cf1d90d", "ja": "大人はこんな話、しないと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "我觉得大人是不会聊这种话题的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_2005_046rio", "source_sha256": "58d1c3d0baebe91323f53d529ae35fb235b3ead4c9d7f18818650e483a042ac6", "ja": "いいからいいから～。\nほら、白状しちゃいなさい！", "zh": "好啦好啦～\n你就全招了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_05_2006_p", "source_sha256": "9c7e72c95794ebca37dcc46b8f937c020208ac66327999682c2200eda13b49f2", "ja": "（二人の目が輝いて見えるのは、お酒のせい……\nだけでもなさそうだ。長い夜になりそうだな……）", "zh": "（她们俩眼睛闪闪发光的，应该是因为喝了酒……\n但好像也不只如此，看来今晚会很漫长……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
